  "bodyText": "Home\nVisit Us\nExhibitions\nEvents\nOnline Talks\nOxfordshire’s Military Heritage in 50 Objects\nCollections\nBlog\nResearch\nLearning\nShop\nCart\nMy Account\nAbout\nBecome a Friend\nSupport Us\nRoom Hire\n\n01993 810 210\n\nfrontofhouse@sofo.org.uk\n\n  \nHome\nEvents\nExhibitions\nCollections\nFriends’ Membership\nVisit\nShop\nBasket\nMy Account\nOxfordshire’s Military Heritage in 50 Objects\nResearch\nLearning\nOnline Talks\nBlog\nSupport Us\nRoom Hire\nImage Services\nAbout\nNew Legacy Brochure Launched\nBECOME A PRÆTORIAN\n\nOur Prætorians are vital to the success of the museum and helped raise the funds, through membership and events, which enabled the museum to open its galleries in 2014.\nReceiving all the benefits of our Friends membership, Prætorians are also welcomed to an annual lunch event with opportunities to meet the Board, Staff and Volunteers, often in interesting county locations and with speakers who reflect the diverse military heritage of the county.\n\nThe benefits of becoming a Prætorian\n\nFree admission to the museum\n10% discount in the museum shop\nInvitations to our new exhibition openings\nExclusive annual AGM and social event at an interesting county location\nMembership card\nQuarterly newsletter\nInvitations to our lectures and events\n\nHow much is membership?\n\n£30 per month\n£90 per quater\n£360 per year\n\nPlease download and print the Prætorian Application Form here. Completed forms can be returned to:\n\nAdministration\nSOFO Museum\nHarrisons Lane\nWoodstock\nOxfordshire\nOX20 1SS\n\nAlternatively, you can collect forms and hand in your completed application form at the Museum Reception.\n\nSoldiers of Oxfordshire Museum\nPark Street.\nWoodstock\nOxfordshire OX20 1SN\n\nPhone and Email:\nGeneral Enquiries & Event Tickets: 01993 810 211\nfrontofhouse@sofo.org.uk\n\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms and conditions",
